The main business segments of Nestlé are: 
- Zone North America (NA); 
- Zone Europe (EUR); 
- Zone Asia, Oceania and Africa (AOA); 
- Zone Latin America (LATAM); 
- Zone Greater China (GC); 
- Nestlé Health Science; and 
- Nespresso. 
(This information is found in Source 1: Unknown 2024 — Revenue — Page 17, Source 2: Unknown 2024 — Revenue — Page 17, and Source 3: Unknown 2024 — Revenue — Page 17, under the section "The Group’s reportable segments are").
